# i18n

- Every user-facing string is a message key; add it to `en` and `fa` in the same change.
- Locale is the `NEXT_LOCALE` cookie; `lang`/`dir` only on `<html>`.
- `pnpm typecheck` catches unknown keys; `pnpm --filter @repo/i18n test` catches a locale missing keys or placeholders.

Guide: [docs/agents/i18n.md](docs/agents/i18n.md)
